	<title xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">net waste calculation formula</title>
	<explanatoryNote xmlns="https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/">sum (material input values)/sum (material output values)</explanatoryNote>
	<naturalLanguageDefinition xmlns="https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/">the amount of raw materials needed to produce a unit of output, service, or economic sector</naturalLanguageDefinition>
	<adaptedFrom xmlns="https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/">https://unstats.un.org/unsd/post-2015/activities/egm-on-indicator-framework/docs/Background notes on material intensity.pdf</adaptedFrom>
</rdf:Description>

